    "status": "present",
    "value": "A directory tree is given as nested objects. Each directory has a name, a list of subdirectories and a list of files; each file has a name and a flag that marks whether it must end up encrypted. Everything starts unencrypted. One operation encrypts either a single file or every file anywhere inside one directory. Encrypting a file whose flag is false is forbidden. Return the smallest number of operations after which exactly the flagged files are encrypted."
  },
